      displayTexts:
      - 'You carry the baby to the steel door with the love of Spawns in your heart.
        You open the steel doors, and light fills the room. You have become the Vessel. '
      - 'On the surface, you have devoted yourself to being used indefinitely by
        the Spawns and imparting all your lessons to the child. Soon, the child grows
        strong in both mind and body. The Spawns approve of your training, and soon,
        the child is placed back into the labyrinth to experiment with a new and
        better candidate as the Vessel.  '
